      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "WE DON'T NEED IT AND WE DON'T WANT IT!!!!!!!\n\n  IT'S ANNOYING and has ruined quite a few of me and my friends hang outs!!! I hate getting told the lobby was open for \"too long\" or getting randomly kicked just cuz this system thinks i have been still or quiet too long. \n\n  I can't speak for everyone, but as for me and the people I hang out with in VRC we don't always have alot of people comeing and going all the time and yes there are extended periods of time were we dont run around the world. so yes it gets infuriating having to constantly make new worlds cuz it got automaticly closed or one of us got kicked from a lobby durring a game or while vibing to music just because they werent moving for a bit it and gets stuck in and sometimes cant rejoin cuz they get stuck in the infinate loading screen it absolutely sucks!!!\n\n On top of that there is no reason for this system! As stated very well by PHEONIX2145 it does NOT help with any ACTUAL issues VRC has if anything it just makes it so that people question if its worth it to get on. \n\nPlease for the love of everything just remove the system we hate it....",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-12T05:00:14.174Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please remove the instance timeout feature, it's super intrusive and looks like a \"Silent\" addition to try to control us users who just play the game and chill with our friends. All we do is hangout and watch videos and we get randomly kicked from our world only to reappear in the EXACT same instance with same ID under the guise of \"refreshing the instance\" when all it does is interrupt what we're doing and stops what we're doing and even sometimes breaks things like persistence worlds. I implore you quickly revert/remove this feature, pronto!",
